<title>JAPAN: Japan June nickel imports up 46.6 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan June nickel imports up 46.6 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined nickel imports totalled 6,263 tonnes in June, up 46.6 percent from 4,273 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Tuesday showed. Details were as follows (on a customs-cleared basis, in tonnes):</p>
<p>		 June 97	   May 97	  June 96</p>
<p>Total	  6,263	    6,367	    4,273</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p>Russia	 1,459	    1,030	     347</p>
<p>Zimbabwe	 566	    1,022	     538</p>
<p>Australia	324		598	     382</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first six months of 1997 totalled 33,901 tonnes, up from 29,866 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
